  "body": "Showcasing style and sophistication Brand New Build,  superior offering for the discerning buyer. Located in the heart of Gulf Harbour lies architecturally designed home. The unique location, shrouded by view is elevated for uninterrupted views ,  Enjoy the luxury of your local favourite. \r\n\r\nCareful planning and design see each of these exclusive,  homes enjoying extensive views from their living areas. Freehold sites catering to low maintenance living provide a focus on leisure and entertaining. four-bedroom options (with two ensuite and one combine bathroom), there is a design layout to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nQuality features adorn the interiors giving you everything you may want or need. Open plan living spaces are complimented by raked ceilings and invite you towards a well-positioned deck taking full advantage . An exquisitely crafted kitchen, complete with scullery is fashioned for entertaining with engineered stone island bench tops and European appliances providing the desirable finish.\r\n\r\nDesigned for ease of living, the master bedrooms are also located and include a generous walk-in-wardrobe and porcelain tiled ensuite. Family and guests are catered with layout options that promote comfort and space.\r\nA double garage completes the layout providing internal access and convenient storage, a recreational necessity for the Golf lifestyle. \r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure this stunning new home in a highly sought-after neighborhood. Act now - your dream home awaits!",
